# SecurePipeline Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph CI[GitHub Actions CI]
        A[Push / PR] --> B[Checkout]
        B --> C[Install scanners]
        C --> D[Run scanners in parallel]
        D --> E[Aggregate results]
        E --> F[Security Gate]
        F -->|Pass| G[Continue to build]
        F -->|Block| H[Fail job]
        G --> I[Docker build]
        I --> J[Trivy image scan]
        J --> K[Upload final reports]
    end

    subgraph Backend[FastAPI Backend]
        L[POST /api/reports] --> M[Store in SQLite]
        M --> N[GET /api/dashboard/summary]
        M --> O[GET /api/vulnerabilities]
    end

    subgraph Frontend[React Dashboard]
        P[Axios calls] --> N
        P --> O
    end

    H -.-> L
    K --> L
```
